  "description": "LLamaSharp is a cross-platform library to run 🦙LLaMA/Mtmd model (and others) in your local device. \n      Based on [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp), inference with LLamaSharp is efficient on both CPU and GPU. \n      With the higher-level APIs and RAG support, it's convenient to deploy LLM (Large Language Model) in your application with LLamaSharp.",
